    What the app's FileProvider is willing to hand out — the diagnostics directory, and
    nothing else. `media/` sits beside it under filesDir and holds the user's captured
    photographs and recordings; sharing a log must not become a door onto those, so the path
    is named exactly rather than granted as `files-path .` with an empty path.
-->
<paths>
    <files-path
        name="diagnostics"
        path="diagnostics/" />
</paths>
